请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-29-elderly-care-003

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
文字叠背景图上那种，显示一行带数字的，点一下打电话，能读天气

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "文字叠背景图上那种，显示一行带数字的，点一下打电话，能读天气",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToCallPhone",
      "args": {
        "phoneNumber": "13800008001"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "contact": {
      "name": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "被看护老人或亲人称呼，用于识别当前关怀对象。",
        "sampleValue": "妈妈"
      },
      "phoneTail": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "电话号码后四位脱敏展示文本，用于拨号入口提示。",
        "sampleValue": "8001"
      }
    },
    "data": {
      "weather": {
        "location": {
          "districtName": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "天气查询的区县名称。",
            "sampleValue": "朝阳区"
          }
        },
        "current": {
          "temperatureText": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前温度展示文本。",
            "sampleValue": "28°C"
          },
          "condition": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前天气现象。",
            "sampleValue": "多云"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/icon_weather1.png",
      "description": "亲人关怀场景的天气雨伞图标，可作为天气背景图形或天气状态视觉锚点。"
    }
  ]
}

=== 待评审 DSL (card.dsl.jsonl，共 3 行) ===
